  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Natural Resources Development Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective is to establish or maintain sustainable, community-based natural resource management in about 218 communes in upland and mountainous erosion-prone lands. This will lead to enhanced productivity and incomes derived from sustainable resource management, reduced soil degradation, improved water management, conservation of biodiversity, and strengthened public sector management of these resources.</narrative>
  </description>
